105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 98 0 R
/T (The Hiring Process is Fundamentally Broken for Job Seekers)
/E (The Hiring Process is Fundamentally Broken for Job Seekers)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (Today's recruitment ecosystem has become increasingly automated, yet the job application process remains overwhelmingly manual from the applicant's perspective. Every day, thousands of new opportunities are published across company career pages, job boards, applicant tracking systems \(ATS\), and professional networks. For candidates, discovering relevant roles before they become saturated is already a significant challenge. Applying effectively to each opportunity is even more demanding.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (Modern recruitment systems evaluate applicants using ATS platforms that prioritize resumes closely aligned with the job description. Consequently, candidates are expected to repeatedly customize resumes, write tailored cover letters, answer application-specific questions, and complete lengthy forms for every individual position.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (This creates several critical problems:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 420 0 R
/E <54696D652D696E74656E73697665206170706C69636174696F6E733A204120686967682D7175616C697479206170706C69636174696F6E207479706963616C6C79207265717569726573203230853630206D696E75746573206F66206D616E75616C206566666F72742E>
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 421 0 R
/E (Missed opportunities: Many positions receive hundreds of applications within the first few hours of posting, reducing visibility for late applicants.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 422 0 R
/E (Low personalization at scale: Most candidates either submit a generic resume with poor ATS performance or spend excessive time tailoring each application.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 423 0 R
/E (Fragmented job discovery: Relevant positions are scattered across numerous career portals and recruitment platforms.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
113 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 424 0 R
/E (Repetitive administrative work: Applicants repeatedly enter identical personal information across different application systems.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 425 0 R
/E (Inconsistent application quality: Manual processes introduce human error and inconsistent resume optimization.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (As a result, highly qualified candidates spend the majority of their job search performing repetitive administrative tasks rather than improving their skills, preparing for interviews, or networking. The current workflow is inefficient, reactive, and difficult to scale.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
